('37', 'vc_title', 'Vice Chancellor'),
('38', 'vc_msg', 'It is my distinct honor and privilege to welcome you to Sarvepalli Radhakrishnan University (SRKU), Bhopal. As Vice Chancellor, my primary commitment is to create an inspiring, inclusive, and forward-looking academic ecosystem where intellectual rigor meets societal responsibility.'),
